000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. KSDSNATR.
000300*    KSDSRAND, written against native VSAM instead of VSAMIO.
000400*    Adds, changes and deletes KSDS records by key.
000500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000700 FILE-CONTROL.
000800     SELECT RECORD-IMAGES ASSIGN TO UR-2540R-S-CARDIN.
000900     SELECT KSDS-FILE ASSIGN TO KSDSF01
001000         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001100         ACCESS IS RANDOM
001200         RECORD KEY IS KR-KEY
001300         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001400 DATA DIVISION.
001500 FILE SECTION.
001600 FD  RECORD-IMAGES
001700     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
001800 01  RECORD-IMAGE.
001900     02  RI-ACTION               PIC X(01).
002000     02  FILLER                  PIC X(01).
002100     02  RI-IMAGE                PIC X(78).
002200 FD  KSDS-FILE
002300     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002400     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002500 01  KSDS-RECORD.
002600     02  KR-KEY                  PIC X(10).
002700     02  FILLER                  PIC X(70).
002800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002900 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC X(2) VALUE '00'.
003000 01  END-OF-FILE-SWITCH          PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
003100     88  END-OF-FILE                      VALUE 'Y'.
003200 01  FOUND-SWITCH                PIC X(1) VALUE 'Y'.
003300     88  FOUND                            VALUE 'Y'.
003400 01  OP-FAILED-SWITCH            PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
003500     88  OP-FAILED                        VALUE 'Y'.
003600 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003700 000-INITIATE.
003800     DISPLAY 'KSDSRAND: READ/REWRITE KSDS DIRECT'.
003900     DISPLAY '----------------------------------'.
004000     DISPLAY ' '.
004100     OPEN INPUT RECORD-IMAGES.
004200     OPEN I-O KSDS-FILE.
004300     IF WS-STATUS NOT = '00'
004400         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR DURING OPEN, STATUS ' WS-STATUS
004500         MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
004600 010-PROCESS.
004700     PERFORM 110-PROCESS-UPDATES THRU 119-EXIT UNTIL END-OF-FILE.
004800 020-TERMINATE.
004900     CLOSE RECORD-IMAGES.
005000     CLOSE KSDS-FILE.
005100     STOP RUN.
005200 110-PROCESS-UPDATES.
005300     READ RECORD-IMAGES
005400         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
005500     IF NOT END-OF-FILE
005600         PERFORM 111-DISPATCH THRU 112-EXIT.
005700 119-EXIT.
005800     EXIT.
005900 111-DISPATCH.
006000     IF RI-ACTION = 'A'
006100         PERFORM 120-ADD-PROCESS THRU 129-EXIT.
006200     IF RI-ACTION = 'C'
006300         PERFORM 130-CHANGE-PROCESS THRU 139-EXIT.
006400     IF RI-ACTION = 'D'
006500         PERFORM 140-DELETE-PROCESS THRU 149-EXIT.
006600 112-EXIT.
006700     EXIT.
006800 120-ADD-PROCESS.
006900     MOVE RI-IMAGE TO KSDS-RECORD.
007000     DISPLAY 'ADDING: ' KSDS-RECORD.
007100     MOVE 'N' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
007200     WRITE KSDS-RECORD
007300         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
007400     IF NOT OP-FAILED
007500         DISPLAY '               RECORD ADDED'.
007600     IF OP-FAILED AND WS-STATUS = '22'
007700         DISPLAY '            *** DUPLICATE RECORD ON FILE'.
007800     IF OP-FAILED AND WS-STATUS NOT = '22'
007900         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON WRITE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
008000     DISPLAY ' '.
008100 129-EXIT.
008200     EXIT.
008300 130-CHANGE-PROCESS.
008400     PERFORM 150-READ-RECORD THRU 159-EXIT.
008500     IF NOT FOUND
008600         DISPLAY '          *** RECORD NOT FOUND'
008700         DISPLAY ' '.
008800     IF FOUND
008900         PERFORM 132-DO-CHANGE THRU 133-EXIT.
009000 139-EXIT.
009100     EXIT.
009200 132-DO-CHANGE.
009300     DISPLAY KSDS-RECORD.
009400     DISPLAY '               RECORD BEFORE CHANGE'.
009500     MOVE RI-IMAGE TO KSDS-RECORD.
009600     MOVE 'N' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
009700     REWRITE KSDS-RECORD
009800         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
009900     IF NOT OP-FAILED
010000         DISPLAY KSDS-RECORD
010100         DISPLAY '               RECORD AFTER CHANGE'.
010200     IF OP-FAILED
010300         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON REWRITE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
010400     DISPLAY ' '.
010500 133-EXIT.
010600     EXIT.
010700 140-DELETE-PROCESS.
010800     PERFORM 150-READ-RECORD THRU 159-EXIT.
010900     IF NOT FOUND
011000         DISPLAY '          *** RECORD NOT FOUND'
011100         DISPLAY ' '.
011200     IF FOUND
011300         PERFORM 142-DO-DELETE THRU 143-EXIT.
011400 149-EXIT.
011500     EXIT.
011600 142-DO-DELETE.
011700     DISPLAY KSDS-RECORD.
011800     DISPLAY '               RECORD BEFORE DELETE'.
011900     MOVE 'N' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
012000     DELETE KSDS-FILE
012100         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
012200     IF NOT OP-FAILED
012300         DISPLAY '             DELETED '.
012400     IF OP-FAILED
012500         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON DELETE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
012600     DISPLAY ' '.
012700 143-EXIT.
012800     EXIT.
012900 150-READ-RECORD.
013000     MOVE RI-IMAGE TO KSDS-RECORD.
013100     DISPLAY 'ATTEMPTING TO READ: ' KR-KEY.
013200     MOVE 'Y' TO FOUND-SWITCH.
013300     READ KSDS-FILE
013400         INVALID KEY MOVE 'N' TO FOUND-SWITCH.
013500     IF NOT FOUND AND WS-STATUS NOT = '23'
013600         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON READ, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
013700 159-EXIT.
013800     EXIT.
